# Pairs with RAllOrNothing. The re-seed clear discards the buckets of a saga the
# export carried as prepared rows (undecided at the cut), so its terminals after
# the rewind commit keys with no bucket. #4631 keeps a carried saga's buckets.
MODULE: RAllOrNothingReseedClearsCarriedBucket
TARGET: RAllOrNothing
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the re-seed drain discards every leftover bucket of an undecided saga, the carried ones included
PERTURBS: ReseedDrain
BOUNDS: LossPath = 1, JoinStart = 0, SagaOutcome = 0, Shape = 0

--- FIND
                        ELSE IF APrep(snap, k) /\ rterm[k] = "none" THEN "pending"
                        ELSE IF snap = "inflight" /\ ~ACarried(snap) THEN "none"

--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the clear discards carried buckets too.
                        ELSE IF snap = "inflight" THEN "none"
                        ELSE IF APrep(snap, k) /\ rterm[k] = "none" THEN "pending"

--- END
